  "question": {
    "text": "Block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;starts from rest and accelerates as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Simultaneously another end of the string is pulled with constant acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>. If at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>, block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;comes to rest then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>) is equal to<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0085_d37e340843c4.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 110px; width: 120px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "18",
  "solution": {
    "text": "12<em>t</em> – 2<em>a<sub>A</sub></em> – <em>a</em><sub>0</sub> = 0<br />⇒ <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br />⇒ <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>t</mi></math><br />⇒&nbsp;<em>v</em> = 0, ⇒&nbsp; <math><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />⇒&nbsp;<em>a</em><sub>0</sub> = 6<em>t</em><div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 2px; top: 38px;\"><div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div></div>"
  }
